[
  {"comment": "Recompute speed (P10): a model whose features take the slow paths seen in imported designs. cli.perf_recompute opens the saved model and reports how long each feature took. A 120 x 120 x 6 plate centred on the origin (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2)."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [-60, -60], "width": 120, "height": 120},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 6}, "operation": "new_body"}},

  {"comment": "144 holes of 3 mm (Sketch2 F3, Extrude2 F4, RectangularPattern1 F5): Adjust cuts the copies from the large body in one boolean operation. 120*120*6 - 144*pi*1.5**2*6."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F3", "center": [-55, -55], "diameter": 3},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "through_all"}, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F2.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F4"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": "x", "quantity": 12, "distance": 10},
    "direction2": {"axis": "y", "quantity": 12, "distance": 10},
    "distance_type": "spacing", "compute": "adjust"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "RectangularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "Body1",
    "volume": 80292.74388142144, "faces": 150}},

  {"comment": "Four pins standing on the plate as bodies of their own (Sketch3 F6, Extrude3 F7), like parts on a circuit board."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F6", "center": [10, 10], "diameter": 4},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F6", "center": [-10, 10], "diameter": 4},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F6", "center": [-10, -10], "diameter": 4},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F6", "center": [10, -10], "diameter": 4},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F6", "region": "r{c1}"}, {"sketch": "F6", "region": "r{c3}"},
                 {"sketch": "F6", "region": "r{c5}"}, {"sketch": "F6", "region": "r{c7}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 6},
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude3", "status": "ok", "bodies": 5, "body": "F7.b0", "volume": 125.66370614359172}},

  {"comment": "A boss joined to all bodies (Sketch4 F8, Extrude4 F9): only the plate is near it. Then eight of it around the origin (CircularPattern1 F10, Identical): the copies' box holds the pins, which the copies do not touch."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F8", "center": [42.42640687119285, 0], "diameter": 6},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F8", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 6},
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 4}, "operation": "join"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude4", "status": "ok", "bodies": 5, "body": "Body1", "volume": 80405.84121695067}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "circular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F9"]},
    "axis": "z", "quantity": 8, "angle": 6.283185307179586, "compute": "identical"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "CircularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 5, "body": "Body1",
    "volume": 81197.5225656553}},

  {"comment": "The plate's corners rounded (Fillet1 F11: 600 - 150*pi less), then its top rim (Fillet2 F12, the tangent chain of one edge): (1 - pi/4) along 440 mm of sides and, by Pappus, four quarter turns at radius 5 - (10 - 3 pi)/(12 - 3 pi)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F2.b0", "radius": 5, "edges": [
    "E{F2:side(c1[c4,c2])|F2:side(c2[c1,c3])}", "E{F2:side(c2[c1,c3])|F2:side(c3[c2,c4])}",
    "E{F2:side(c3[c2,c4])|F2:side(c4[c3,c1])}", "E{F2:side(c1[c4,c2])|F2:side(c4[c3,c1])}"]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 81068.76146369377}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F2.b0", "radius": 1, "edges": [
    "E{F2:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F2:side(c1[c4,c2])}"]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Fillet2", "status": "ok", "bodies": 5, "body": "Body1", "volume": 80967.89592561091}}
]
